                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c60b62ba-0d34-32f3-abfa-d251e2b097ff",
                        "entry_id": "c0706955-d5cd-3539-b134-86cc612a5b57",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Se dit de processus (surtout informatiques ou technologiques) qui sont automatiques et apparemment magiques (parce que le spectateur ne sait pas du tout comment procéder s’il avait à le faire lui-même)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Par plaisanterie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "df657e36-d3bb-471d-a991-40983b7081f9",
                                "sense_id": "c60b62ba-0d34-32f3-abfa-d251e2b097ff",
                                "text": "Le destructeur est appelé au niveau de l’accolade fermant le bloc dans lequel l’objet a été créé. La norme C++ le garantit et vous ne pouvez rien faire pour empêcher que ça arrive : c’est automagique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cabe0857-ee67-4e27-a3a6-404663203095",
                                "sense_id": "c60b62ba-0d34-32f3-abfa-d251e2b097ff",
                                "text": "Le choix automagique, privilégiant la carte son additionnelle par rapport à celle intégrée à la carte-mère, est tout à fait logique mais m’embête."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f2a0894c-2779-40cb-b95f-a66011996a6f",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0706955-d5cd-3539-b134-86cc612a5b57",
                        "source_sense_id": "c60b62ba-0d34-32f3-abfa-d251e2b097ff",
                        "target_lang_word": "automagisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce99444a-cded-4585-b68b-812ea896cac7",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0706955-d5cd-3539-b134-86cc612a5b57",
                        "source_sense_id": "c60b62ba-0d34-32f3-abfa-d251e2b097ff",
                        "target_lang_word": "automagical",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "automagical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27e70a9e-7ce8-3e9b-8116-a437755e2ca0",
                                        "entry_id": "3c14cc25-7406-314f-99fc-71f33b820723",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Automatic, but with an apparent element of magic. Commonly referring to complex technical processes hidden from the view of users or operators, resulting in technology that \\\"just works\\\"."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd4d4d3e-ec58-45f6-8193-0c584440e7f3",
                                                "sense_id": "27e70a9e-7ce8-3e9b-8116-a437755e2ca0",
                                                "text": "Throughout this text we will emphasize the employment of a systems approach to the practice of analysis and design. In it we attempt to present this portion of the software lifecycle as a discipline rather than an \"automagical\" (automated magic) process."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce19c45b-c43a-43be-bac9-b706c83bedff",
                                                "sense_id": "27e70a9e-7ce8-3e9b-8116-a437755e2ca0",
                                                "text": "\"How're we paying you, actually?\" I asked.\n \"Certain automagical manipulations.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36bf6fb6-42ea-46a1-9b6a-62c1ece1cfaf",
                                                "sense_id": "27e70a9e-7ce8-3e9b-8116-a437755e2ca0",
                                                "text": "It is hoped that, over time, new e-mail list management tools will become available for users which can \"automagically\" determine who and how to do these…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e52fce8-50d6-4855-89ed-707a81197b60",
                                                "sense_id": "27e70a9e-7ce8-3e9b-8116-a437755e2ca0",
                                                "text": "In the more florid cases, where the diagnosis is unmistakeable, several anatomical studies (especially with automagical computerized devices, such as positron emission tomography and magnetic resonance imaging) have shown clear though subtle differences in the brains of schizophrenic patients…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f343d210-b391-4f50-8a0f-733cb94680bf",
                                                "sense_id": "27e70a9e-7ce8-3e9b-8116-a437755e2ca0",
                                                "text": "These result [sic] indicate that the more complex the system, and the less the human feels aware of how the system is operating (i.e. to what degree it seems ‘automagical’) the less effective the operator becomes in correctly identifying problematic situations and taking the necessary corrective action."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
